#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-apm2x-atmega32u2.rst:19
#: 6f450ad598a54626b224dd2bb237ea85
msgid "How to flash the Atmega32U2 (PPM encoder) through USB"
msgstr "如何通过 USB 刷写 Atmega32U2（PPM 编码器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-apm2x-atmega32u2.rst:21
#: 22d90ccb00514181a4ee2ffa823530ef
msgid ""
"If you every find yourself in a situation where your PPM encoder has become "
"corrupted for some reason, or you want to upload a new version, you can. The"
" PPM encoder (ATMega32-U2) has an special bootloader that allows you to "
"flash it without needing a special SPI programmer. The 32U2 firmware "
"controls the USB connection to the 2560 and is also used to convert radio "
"PCM signals to a PPM signal for the 2560.  APM 2.5 modules shipped before "
"March 4th 2013  have an older version of the firmware. Here is a discussion "
"on the newer \\ `firmware <https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/new-"
"arduppm-firmware-version-2-3-16-in-the-downloads-section>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您发现 PPM 编码器因某种原因损坏，或需要上传新版本，可以进行操作。PPM 编码器（ATMega32-U2）具有特殊引导程序，允许您在不使用专用 "
"SPI 烧录器的情况下刷写。32U2 固件控制与 2560 的 USB 连接，也用于将遥控 PCM 信号转换为 2560 的 PPM 信号。2013 年"
" 3 月 4 日之前出货的 APM 2.5 模块具有较旧版本的固件。有关新\\ `固件 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/new-arduppm-firmware-"
"version-2-3-16-in-the-downloads-section>`__ 的讨论见此处。"

