#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-apm2x-atmega32u2.rst:140
#: 0882717725b74e9c83d3dfec6cb3f085
msgid ""
"*Before you upload new firmware you can view the current firmware in the "
"buffer. Some PPM firmware versions will have the version embedded in the "
"code.  Click [Device] [Read] to download the current memory into the buffer "
"and then [Buffer] [Edit] to view. (See Flip manual for details.)  The "
"version may be near the end of the code before all the FF entries.  Here is "
"a sample of the end of the code segment for one version of the PPM "
"firmware.*"
msgstr ""
"*上传新固件前，您可以在缓冲区中查看当前固件。某些 PPM 固件版本会在代码中嵌入版本信息。点击 [Device][Read] "
"将当前内存下载到缓冲区，然后点击 [Buffer][Edit] 查看。（详见 Flip 手册。）版本号可能位于所有 FF "
"条目之前的代码末尾附近。以下是某个 PPM 固件版本代码段末尾的示例。*"

